# EVAL-ONLY witness W-R1 (never in a prompt or training file).
# Folded-cascode first stage + common-source second stage, Miller Cc + nulling Rz.
# Stage 1 = circuits/lib/folded_cascode.net with the inputs swapped (VINP on the output
# side, so o1 is inverting from VINP) and its output renamed o1.
# Stage 2: PMOS CS M13 (gate o1) against the NMOS sink M14 (mirror of n1).
NMOS M1a f1 VINN tail
NMOS M1b f2 VINP tail
PMOS M3a f1 pa VDD
PMOS M3b f2 pa VDD
PMOS M4a c1 vbp f1
PMOS M4b o1 vbp f2
NMOS M5a c1 IREF b1
NMOS M5b o1 IREF b2
NMOS M6a b1 c1 VSS
NMOS M6b b2 c1 VSS
NMOS M9 tail n1 VSS
NMOS M10 n1 n1 VSS
R Rb IREF n1
NMOS M11 vbp n1 VSS
R Rp pa vbp
PMOS M12 pa pa VDD
PMOS M13 VOUT o1 VDD
NMOS M14 VOUT n1 VSS
C Cc o1 nz
R Rz nz VOUT
